{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"nets\":{\"big\":\"X\",\"small\":\"X\",\"core\":\"Y\",\"concise\":\"X\",\"human\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"Y\",\"load\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"big：X 的高亮词能串起从想靠近、怕给对方负担，到被看见后重新靠近、最后接受不确定的变化；Y 的大块多次停在“继续享受／经历亲近”，屏幕间推进较弱。small：X 的非高亮文字补足了动作原因和关系脉络，前后挂得比较紧；core：Y 更集中地把亲密的幸福和留不住它的难受并置，X 后段则扩展到互相需要和自我接纳。concise：X 虽然文字较多，但多数屏幕都有新的关系进展，Y 多次重复仍在享受眼前相处；human：Y 的“继续经历眼前的相处”“正在经历的亲密相处”“没有新的事情要决定”有明显摘要腔，搭配也不够自然；fine：Y 的感受块更集中在观众的身体和关系体验，如喉咙发紧、握手、独处时泛酸，X 的感受中有较多直接描述歌声、声线和音区的内容；load：Y 每屏通常只有一两块大字，X 常有四到六处高亮，尤其短停留屏需要扫过的视觉焦点更多。 \"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cd837e56-e8ee-4edf-b73a-037be7e2b4ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T154548050621Z", "elapsed_seconds": 244.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:49:52.134547+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2f253ca7f9b0242ecee1d5b97e7930b835e552f36793cdb717d3627e45c82f9a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessi